{
    "chapters": {
        "time_travel": {
            "title": "Time Travel",
            "pages": [
                {
                    "paragraphs": [
                        {
                            "type": "image",
                            "image": "primordial_park:handbook/image/time_travel/intro.png"
                        },
                        {
                            "type": "text",
                            "text": "Welcome, Adventurer, to the threshold of deep time! Bound within these pages are the foundational principles of temporal displacement, your guide to navigating hundreds of millions of years of Earth's forgotten history."
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "paragraphs": [
                        {
                            "type": "text",
                            "text": {
                                "text": "Fossils",
                                "bold": true
                            }
                        },
                        {
                            "type": "text",
                            "text": [
                                "You can find fossils all over the world. They come in 3 types:\n- ",
                                {
                                    "text": "Chronal Fossils",
                                    "color": "dark_purple"
                                },
                                " hold data about when the animal lived.\n- ",
                                {
                                    "text": "Genetic Samples",
                                    "color": "dark_purple"
                                },
                                " hold a specific trait that might be extracted.\n- ",
                                {
                                    "text": "Artifacts",
                                    "color": "dark_purple"
                                },
                                " can be used to make weapons, tools, armor or decorations."
                            ]
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "paragraphs": [
                        {
                            "type": "item",
                            "id": "primordial_park:fossil_pouch"
                        },
                        {
                            "type": "text",
                            "text": [
                                "Use a ",
                                {
                                    "text": "Fossil Pouch",
                                    "color": "dark_aqua"
                                },
                                " to collect fossils without cluttering your inventory. These can be set to pick up items automatically into the Pouch."
                            ]
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "paragraphs": [
                        {
                            "type": "text",
                            "text": [
                                "To analyze a Chronal fossil, use the ",
                                {
                                    "text": "Paleontology Table",
                                    "color": "dark_aqua"
                                },
                                ". This block, aside from functioning as the workstation of the ",
                                {
                                    "text": "Paleontologist Villager",
                                    "color": "dark_aqua"
                                },
                                ", will fill ",
                                {
                                    "text": "Report Cards",
                                    "color": "dark_aqua"
                                },
                                " with data from the analyzed fossil, given that its Villager is nearby."
                            ]
                        },
                        {
                            "type": "item",
                            "id": "primordial_park:paleontology_table"
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "paragraphs": [
                        {
                            "type": "text",
                            "text": "The Villager will immediately head for the Paleontology Table when the necessary items are inserted and the analysis can begin."
                        },
                        {
                            "type": "text",
                            "text": "You can automate the analysis. Use hoppers to insert fossils on the top and report cards at the sides of the Paleontology Table. Hoppers below it will extract written report cards. Power the Table, to extract the fossils themselves below. Modded item transportation methods are also compatible."
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "paragraphs": [
                        {
                            "type": "text",
                            "text": "To calibrate the Time Portal, you'll need the report cards of 3 species of the same age."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
